@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Componentes y despliegue — mismo JAR, procesos y almacenes independientes
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Lector / personal" as user
node "Navegador\nP01–P10" as browser
node "Red de borde" {
  component "gateway\nHTTPS :8443\nÚNICO puerto publicado" as gw
}
node "Red privada internal:true — HTTPS" {
  component "secrets :9100\npaquetes por identidad" as secrets
  component "auth :9101" as auth
  component "clients :9102" as clients
  component "inventory :9103" as inventory
  component "orders :9104" as orders
  component "payments :9105\nEXEMPT / 0 CLP" as payments
  component "notifications :9106" as notifications
  component "graphql :9107" as graphql
  component "mail :9108\nPROVEEDOR TEST" as mail
}
node "Red de datos privada (perfil Oracle)" {
  database "Oracle FREEPDB1\nTCPS :2484\nsin puertos publicados\n7 esquemas / 7 usuarios distintos" as oracle
}
user --> browser
browser --> gw : HTTPS / JSON / GraphQL
gw --> auth : login / introspección
gw --> clients
gw --> inventory
gw --> orders
gw --> payments
gw --> graphql
gw --> mail : solo ADMIN + laboratorio
clients --> auth : alta + unicidad / reenvío
auth --> clients : activar
auth --> notifications : activación
orders --> clients : elegibilidad / identidad
orders --> inventory : asignar / confirmar / devolver
orders --> payments : evaluación gratuita
orders --> notifications : outbox
graphql --> clients : ficha filtrada
graphql --> orders : préstamos / reservas
graphql --> inventory : batch documentos
graphql --> payments : batch evaluaciones
notifications --> clients : contacto mínimo
notifications --> mail : API TLS / deduplicación
gw ..> secrets : bootstrap exclusivo
auth ..> secrets
clients ..> secrets
inventory ..> secrets
orders ..> secrets
payments ..> secrets
graphql ..> secrets
notifications ..> secrets
mail ..> secrets
auth --> oracle : solo BEC_AUTH
clients --> oracle : solo BEC_CLIENTS
inventory --> oracle : solo BEC_INVENTORY
orders --> oracle : solo BEC_ORDERS
payments --> oracle : solo BEC_PAYMENTS
notifications --> oracle : solo BEC_NOTIFICATIONS
mail --> oracle : solo BEC_MAIL
note bottom of oracle
Oracle/TCPS/PLSQL/Compose: preparados, NO ejecutados aquí.
Pruebas medidas: 10 JVM + 7 bases H2 EN ARCHIVO,
cada una bajo su directorio privado; no es Oracle.
end note
note bottom of gw
En ejecución local: todos ligados a loopback.
En contenedores: solo gateway está en red de borde.
/health revela vida, no autoriza ni prueba toda dependencia.
end note
@enduml
